dden\" value=\"52507825\"/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271058173669783.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image003(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>aluminum submersible drainage pump</strong></p><p><img alt=\"QDX.\" height=\"939\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/Content/uploads/2022348866/20220419140029d8375e2b53a34e8b9764e1d7bd9fd906.jpg\" title=\"QDX.\" width=\"800\"/></p><p>JIADI pump Industry is an independent privately owned developer and manufacturer of pump with a professional research team and sale team. Aluminum submersible drainage pump is one of the best products we possess. We are inclined to sale our products to more and more customers and become a world famous pump brand.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter</strong></p><p><strong>Place of Origin:</strong> Taizhou, Zhejiang, China (Mainland)</p><p><strong>Brand Name:</strong> JIADI</p><p><strong>Model Number: </strong>QDX</p><p><strong>Capacity: </strong>1.5-15 m³/h</p><p><strong>Head: </strong>7-32 m</p><p><strong>Structure: </strong>Submersible drainage pump </p><p><strong>Series:</strong> QDX </p><p><strong>Power: </strong>Hydraulic</p><p><strong>Standard or Nonstandard:</strong> Standard</p><p><strong>Pressure: </strong>High Pressure</p><p><strong>Quality Warranty: </strong>1 year</p><p><strong>Insulation class: </strong>B</p><p><strong>Protection grade: </strong>IP68</p><p><strong>Supply Ability: </strong>100,000 Pieces per Month</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271100157756869.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271100197216313.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Production Application</strong></p><p>This submersible water pump are uses for Well pumping, river pumping, farming irrigation, water supply and drainage in breeding industry and domestic use, etc.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271101138956482.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Company profile </strong></p><p>Established over 20 years ago, this family-owned business has grown to become one of the leading pump company in supplying drinking water products and well water systems. We believe that our commitment to R&amp;D will be what continues to distinguish JIADI in the industry for decades to come. We believe that it is both our privilege and obligation to develop the technology and products necessary to solve the world’s most challenging water quality issues.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271101176688981.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Why choose us</strong></p><p>1. We promise that each pump will be packed in a box or according to your special requirements. </p><p>2. Reply your inquiry ASAP in 24 working hours.</p><p>3. We accept customized design. Welcome for inqury.</p><p>4. Every customer will get our unique and correct solutions to their special conditions.</p><p>5. We will be honest, sincere and loyal to our customers and we WON’T use inferior material for higher profits. ONLY the satisfaction of customers is our final goal!</p><p><strong>7. Exhibition</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271101237178971.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: What’s your MOQ?</strong></p><p>A: Sample for testing is available. Large order is welcomed and competitive price will be offered.</p><p><strong>2. Q: Why the price is lower?</strong></p><p>A: We are a manufacture, so there is no agency fee. You are able to get the pump directly with a worthwhile price.</p><p><strong>3. Q: What should I know if you want to get a quotation?</strong></p><p>A: Pump capacity, pump head, medium, medium temperature, pump material, quantity.</p><p>If possible, please also provide the pump model you are using now, price will be calculated as per the pump model.</p><p>If not, we will recommend relevant product for reference</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: aluminum submersible drainage pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/submersible-pump-impeller-design\"><img alt=\"Submersible Pump Impeller Design\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-pump-impeller-design44280348583a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/submersible-pump-impeller-design\">Submersible Pump Impeller Design</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-screw-pump/3-diameter-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"3 Diameter Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-diameter-submersible-pump45449414849a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-screw-pump/3-diameter-submersible-pump\">3 Diameter Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-bore-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Bore Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-bore-pump39394512947a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-bore-pump\">Submersible Bore Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-peripheral-submersible-pump/high-cost-performance-submeisible-pump\"><img alt=\"High Cost Performance Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/high-cost-performance-submeisible-pump53170658355a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-peripheral-submersible-pump/high-cost-performance-submeisible-pump\">High Cost Performance Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/submers